{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["וַיַּסַּע — causativo [binyan hif'il], ao passo que וַיִּסַּע [qal]: ele mesmo viajou. Do mesmo modo: ״וַיַּפֵּל בְּקֶרֶב מַחֲנֵהוּ״; ״וַיַּגֵּשׁ אֶת פַּר הַחַטָּאת״ — formas causativas. Mas וַיִּפֹּל e וַיִּגַּשׁ — formas qal."], :book "exodus", :voice :rashbam, :lang :pt, :chapter 15, :timestamp "2026-07-30T21:07:07.069360537Z", :translated-from :en, :model "glm-5.2"}